Bundled data payloads (data/register.json, data/corrections.json) incorporate
material published under Creative Commons Attribution 4.0:

  - GTA VI Landmarks Data and GTA VI Map Tiles - GTADB / Map GTA (gtadb.org)
  - GTA 6 map points - mapheist.com
  - Weekly GTA data feed - GrindMap (grindmap.com)

Attribution is carried inside each payload. Rockstar Games artwork, trailers,
screenshots and the official printable Leonida map are NOT covered by that
licence and are not redistributed in this repository.
